00:05:16.282 --> 00:05:18.751
If I love you a lot, if I like you a lot

00:05:18.751 --> 00:05:20.620
I'll give you a kiss on a cheek

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:21.254
Right

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:24.891
It shows

00:05:26.092 --> 00:05:28.061
