00:05:49.015 --> 00:05:50.216
All over the country

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:51.517
Italian

00:05:52.852 --> 00:05:53.619
Black

00:05:53.986 --> 00:05:54.921
Latino

00:05:55.388 --> 00:05:57.390
