00:06:39.165 --> 00:06:40.767
But it was a big wave before

00:06:40.767 --> 00:06:41.901
World War I, I believe? 

00:06:41.901 --> 00:06:42.535
Yeah

00:06:44.237 --> 00:06:45.371
This was all farmland

00:06:45.371 --> 00:06:46.172
All farmland

00:06:46.172 --> 00:06:48.775
Jonas Bronck, he was a Swedish guy

00:06:48.775 --> 00:06:49.408
Exactly

00:06:49.408 --> 00:06:51.544
And you know the story with him

00:06:52.211 --> 00:06:53.338
And the name how the

00:06:53.338 --> 00:06:56.215
