00:07:56.075 --> 00:07:56.676
What's with that?

00:07:56.676 --> 00:07:57.877
Ahh, they've always been that way

00:07:57.877 --> 00:07:59.278
They've always been that way

00:08:01.347 --> 00:08:02.482
Oh, wow

