00:08:09.355 --> 00:08:09.789
Yeah

00:08:09.789 --> 00:08:10.690
Different owner...

00:08:12.592 --> 00:08:15.361
I think the same family, but...

00:08:15.361 --> 00:08:17.430
Cannoli will always be a cannoli

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:20.833
You're not gonna find a cannoli different anywhere

00:08:20.833 --> 00:08:22.668
Unless you leave New York

00:08:23.636 --> 00:08:24.470
They're all the same?

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:25.338
They're all the same

00:08:25.638 --> 00:08:28.507
It's basically a grilled shell

00:08:28.507 --> 00:08:29.842
I worked in the old pastry shop

00:08:29.842 --> 00:08:31.839
down here with my brothers

00:08:31.839 --> 00:08:33.980
I didn't last long cus I had problems

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:34.981
I'd always

00:08:34.981 --> 00:08:37.717
have more of the cream on me

00:08:37.717 --> 00:08:39.751
than putting it in the shell

00:08:39.751 --> 00:08:40.852
But we all got hired

00:08:40.852 --> 00:08:42.488
by Artuso pastry shop and

00:08:42.488 --> 00:08:43.289
that's what we did

00:08:43.289 --> 00:08:45.124
