00:08:45.124 --> 00:08:46.759
They gave us jobs, you know

00:08:46.759 --> 00:08:47.593
We're doing a church

00:08:47.593 --> 00:08:49.262
and we're going to your block, right?

00:08:50.196 --> 00:08:50.997
