00:08:50.997 --> 00:08:53.366
That’s Our Lady of Mount Carmel

00:08:58.037 --> 00:09:00.539
Old beautiful church

00:09:00.539 --> 00:09:02.542
My mother and father got married in there

00:09:02.542 --> 00:09:05.878
I got baptized, confirmed in there, the whole bit

00:09:05.878 --> 00:09:08.848
Before you do that, homemade

00:09:13.953 --> 00:09:14.887
They're closed, huh?

00:09:20.159 --> 00:09:21.427
Borgatti's

00:09:22.862 --> 00:09:23.796
Gotta come back

00:09:23.796 --> 00:09:25.364
