00:09:25.364 --> 00:09:26.499
I used to sit here

00:09:35.241 --> 00:09:36.175
People lived...

00:09:36.175 --> 00:09:37.643
Well, they still do, live above, huh?

00:09:42.515 --> 00:09:43.649
"Play street"? Stickball?

00:09:45.318 --> 00:09:47.153
It closed in the summer

00:09:50.356 --> 00:09:52.258
