People are getting more religious?

00:12:06.459 --> 00:12:09.095
Saturday, well, this is you know what?

00:12:09.595 --> 00:12:10.663
Because this is uh...

00:12:12.698 --> 00:12:15.868
Latinos are very catholic religious

00:12:15.868 --> 00:12:16.469
Yep

00:12:16.735 --> 00:12:17.903
Ain't that a beautiful church?

00:12:17.903 --> 00:12:18.971
Beautiful

00:12:18.971 --> 00:12:21.740
Now, when I go in there, Pete

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:23.175
I get

00:12:23.175 --> 00:12:25.344
sentimental

00:12:25.344 --> 00:12:26.645
Because that's

00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:29.682
